D valid_vector_checks.ads  20260513024558 478cebd6 valid_vector_checks%s
D valid_vector_checks.adb  20260513024558 84638c94 valid_vector_checks%b
G a e
G c Z s b [is_valid valid_vector_checks 9 12 none]
G c Z s b [is_valid valid_vector_checks 10 12 none]
G r c none [is_valid valid_vector_checks 9 12 none] [is_valid standard_floating_numbers 49 12 none]
G r c none [is_valid valid_vector_checks 10 12 none] [is_valid standard_complex_numbers 75 12 none]
X 2 generic_vectors.ads
16A8*Vector(6|13F8)<9|6I8> 12|9r53[8|4] 10r52[5|4] 13|6r53[8|4] 16r52[5|4]
